| Question type | Tool | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Scope decisions, tradeoffs, A/B/C choices | \`AskUserQuestion\` with options[] | "Should we support X or Y?" |
| Specs, comparisons, detailed options (markdown) | \`ask_user_visual_question\` MCP tool | Domain model review, architecture options |
